# User Firewall Rules (UFW)
# ACTION    DIRECTION  PROTO  FROM             TO               PORT   COMMENT

LIMIT       in         tcp    any              any              22     # SSH rate limiting
ALLOW       in         tcp    any              any              80     # HTTP
ALLOW       in         tcp    any              any              443    # HTTPS
DENY        in         any    192.168.1.200    any              any    # Block malicious IP
ALLOW       out        udp    any              1.1.1.1          53     # Cloudflare DNS
